    "title": "Wednesday afternoon traffic: SR-152 and SR-129 lane closures; minor crash at 7th & Dolores - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lookout Santa Cruz ,\n14 hours ago A silver Honda CRV and a Ford F350 utility truck, including a city vehicle, were involved in a collision at 7th Ave. and Dolores St. in the Eastside / Live Oak area. Both vehicles later returned to the harbor near the launch ramp. No injuries were reported. The incident was reported today. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
